---
title: MF-05 · Resignation during warranty and replacement slot
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CL as Client Company User
  participant API as Finance endpoints
  participant H as Report / Resolve resignation
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor HR as Internal HR
  actor AF as Affiliate
  CL->>API: POST /placements/{id}/resignation
  API->>H: ReportResignation
  H->>DB: Warranty CLAIMED, Commission ON_HOLD
  HR->>API: POST /placements/{id}/resignation/resolve
  alt HR confirms
  H->>DB: Warranty VOIDED, Placement LEFT_DURING_WARRANTY, Commission CANCELLED
  H->>DB: ReplacementSlot OPEN (WAITING_PAYMENT if fee unpaid)
  else HR rejects
  H->>DB: Warranty ACTIVE, Commission back to IN_WARRANTY
  end
  H->>AF: Notify result
  CL->>API: Fill slot with a new placement
  H->>DB: Slot FILLED, no new service fee
